WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.040
- You recently lost your mama

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.540
and this book is dedicated to her.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.583
So, how did she inspire it?

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:07.373
- Yeah, I mean,

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:10.650
my mom has been a huge
inspiration in my life.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.670
- That's awesome.
- Yeah,

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.160
and I dedicated the book to her

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.630
when I found out she had ALS,

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.450
and I was gonna dedicate
it to her anyways.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.033
But she died only a few weeks ago.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.440
And she had a stroke when
she gave birth to me,

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.660
she's faced so many obstacles in her life,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.810
and it really gave me a
perspective on my life

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.220
and how I approach it.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.230
And whenever I have a bad day,

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:35.370
I looked at my mom

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.040
and I said, "Well, she
has a positive attitude.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:38.873
Why can't I?"

00:00:38.873 --> 00:00:42.380
So she was such an
inspiration to me and...

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.790
it's been hard.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.710
- It's a really beautiful thing, though,

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.090
to know that you had that.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.920
Not everybody gets that, right, in life.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.480
It's such a hard thing to grieve.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.540
But, just to know, it's
such a beautiful thing, too,

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.250
to have had a mom that
had that kind of impact

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.930
that you do something cool
like this, and dedicate it,

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.420
and know that it's one of the main reasons

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.980
why you got where you are.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:02.813
- Yeah.

00:01:02.813 --> 00:01:04.323
- [Kelly] It's so really
cool to have that.

00:01:04.323 --> 00:01:05.773
It's beautiful.
- Thank you.

